  "number": 5990,
  "title": "Bump @babel/runtime in embed to 7.29.7",
  "body": "> Supersedes the `packages/embed` part of #5587 and #5832 (Dependabot, both closed as superseded by `main`).\n\n## Changelog Entry\n\n### Changed\n\n- Bumped [`@babel/runtime@7.29.7`](https://npmjs.com/package/@babel/runtime/v/7.29.7) in embed, in PR [#5990](https://github.com/microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat/pull/5990), by [@OEvgeny](https://github.com/OEvgeny)\n\n## Description\n\n`packages/embed` still pins `@babel/runtime@7.17.2`, which is affected by CVE-2025-27789 (fixed in 7.26.10). This bumps it to 7.29.7, the version every other package uses.\n\n## Specific Changes\n\n- `packages/embed/package.json`: `@babel/runtime` 7.17.2 → 7.29.7\n\n- [ ] I have added tests and executed them locally\n- [ ] I have added `.changelog/<PR#>-<slug>.md`\n- [ ] I have updated documentation\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\n\n- [ ] Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)\n- [ ] Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed\n- [ ] CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)\n- [ ] Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)\n- [ ] Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)\n- [ ] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\n- [ ] Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)\n- [ ] Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)\n",
